e icon","courier-service-warrington.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":58,"y":58,"zoom":59,"background":60},{"title":109,"content":110,"icon":114},"Parcel cover included",[111],{"type":65,"text":112,"spans":113,"direction":68},"Each parcel includes up to £20 free parcel cover.* Increase cover up to £999 and add a digital signature for extra security. *Excludes Postable parcels.",[],{"dimensions":115,"alt":116,"copyright":44,"url":117,"id":118,"edit":119},{"width":90,"height":90},"Parcelshop icon","courier-service-warrington.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F6fb8763e-f02b-40b7-8e67-a916528bac93_parcelshop.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsl",{"x":58,"y":58,"zoom":59,"background":95},{"title":121,"content":122,"icon":126},"A fast and reliable delivery service",[123],{"type":65,"text":124,"spans":125,"direction":68},"We’re used and trusted by some of the biggest brands like John Lewis, Hello Fresh, Boohoo and more. ",[],{"dimensions":127,"alt":128,"copyright":44,"url":129,"id":130,"edit":131},{"width":90,"height":90},"Locker icon","courier-service-warrington.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F27883279-ce7e-438b-9385-7cc38a072198_locker.svg","Yh96FxIAACgA-ZsL",{"x":58,"y":58,"zoom":59,"background":95},{"theme":133,"title":134,"description":44},"standard","Why choose Evri in Warrington?","list_block$214cb5e7-f6a9-4679-b42a-f2810e1163e8","list_block",{"variation":138,"version":25,"items":139,"primary":205,"id":216,"slice_type":217,"slice_label":44},"3Column",[140,165,184],{"Title":141,"Description":146,"Image":150,"Label":44,"UrlText":159,"Url":160,"buttonDataGtmTrack":44,"SecondaryButtonText":44,"SecondaryButtonUrl":163,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":44,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[142],{"type":143,"text":144,"spans":145},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[147],{"type":65,"text":148,"spans":149,"direction":68},"Evri ParcelShops allow you to send, collect and return parcels all in one place. We have many ParcelShops around Warrington, making it easy to find one convenient for you. ",[],{"dimensions":151,"alt":154,"copyright":44,"url":155,"id":156,"edit":157},{"width":152,"height":153},1000,665,"Customer walking towards a ParcelShop store holding a parcel. The blue Evri signage can be seen on the storefront with a free-standing sign near the entrance.","courier-service-warrington.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2863.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C7723%2C5136&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1",{"x":58,"y":158,"zoom":59,"background":60},8,"Find your local ParcelShop",{"link_type":74,"key":161,"url":162},"336a1c9c-cded-49c3-b7cd-b45b146f9a5e","courier-service-warrington.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop",{"link_type":164},"Any",{"Title":166,"Description":170,"Image":174,"Label":44,"UrlText":180,"Url":181,"buttonDataGtmTrack":44,"SecondaryButtonText":44,"SecondaryButtonUrl":183,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":44,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[167],{"type":143,"text":168,"spans":169},"Lockers",[],[171],{"type":65,"text":172,"spans":173,"direction":68},"As well as our convenient ParcelShops, here at Evri we also offer secure contact free Lockers where you can drop off or collect parcels securely.  ",[],{"dimensions":175,"alt":176,"copyright":44,"url":177,"id":178,"edit":179},{"width":152,"height":153},"Customer standing outside with a blue Evri Locker in the background. They are holding a parcel and smiling for the photo.","courier-service-warrington.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi",{"x":58,"y":158,"zoom":59,"background":60},"Find your nearest parcel Locker",{"link_type":74,"key":182,"url":162},"31fc5ece-946b-4ef0-8865-7e61f2b3b8c4",{"link_type":164},{"Title":185,"Description":189,"Image":193,"Label":44,"UrlText":200,"Url":201,"buttonDataGtmTrack":44,"SecondaryButtonText":44,"SecondaryButtonUrl":204,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":44,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[186],{"type":143,"text":187,"spans":188},"Courier collection",[],[190],{"type":65,"text":191,"spans":192,"direction":68},"Can’t fit in a drop off for your parcel? Don’t worry, Evri offers courier collection in Warrington. An Evri courier can come straight to your front door or workplace to collect your parcel. You’ll also get a 1-hour collection window, so you know when to expect your courier.  ",[],{"dimensions":194,"alt":195,"copyright":44,"url":196,"id":197,"edit":198},{"width":152,"height":153},"An older woman hands a parcel to a courier for collection. The courier is taking a photo.","courier-service-warrington.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6ou1pbqstJ9-cSH_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10245.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=68%2C0%2C7675%2C5104&w=1000&h=665","Z6ou1pbqstJ9-cSH",{"x":199,"y":58,"zoom":59,"background":60},68,"Schedule a Courier collection",{"link_type":74,"key":202,"url":203},"c73e304a-ac43-4913-bf1b-f9558d5143b1","courier-service-warrington.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":164},{"SectionTitle":206,"SectionDescription":211,"theme":215},[207],{"type":208,"text":209,"spans":210,"direction":68},"heading2","Choose from three easy ways to send a parcel",[],[212],{"type":65,"text":213,"spans":214,"direction":68},"At Evri we’ve got a drop-off method to suit everyone’s parcel sending needs. Just pick one of the following ways to get your parcel on the road:",[],"neutral","article_link_module$bed260e1-ff3e-4d98-aae4-b4369a059dae","article_link_module",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":219,"primary":232,"id":234,"slice_type":235,"slice_label":44},[220,226],{"questionTitle":221,"questionBody":222},"Do parcels come with cover included? ",[223],{"type":65,"text":224,"spans":225,"direction":68},"Every parcel includes £20 free parcel cover, with the option to increase coverage up to £999. Excludes postable parcels.   ",[],{"questionTitle":227,"questionBody":228},"Can an Evri courier collect parcels from workplaces as well as homes? ",[229],{"type":65,"text":230,"spans":231,"direction":68},"Yes, collections can take place from your home, office or workplace. Giving you flexibility based on your schedule. ",[],{"title":233},"Courier services in Warrington FAQs","frequently_asked_questions$946159b4-85d5-4007-b7a6-5a720079f098","frequently_asked_questions",[23,45,79,137,218],{"heroCardContent":238},[239],{"id":29,"uid":44,"url":44,"type":30,"href":240,"tags":241,"first_publication_date":33,"last_publication_date":34,"slugs":242,"linked_documents":243,"lang":15,"alternate_languages":244,"data":245},"courier-service-warrington.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZgVcQRIAACEApjZD%22%29+%5D%5D",[],[32],[],[],{"monotypeTitle":246,"heading":254,"headingSupplement":255,"subheading":256,"promoText":257,"headingInternational":258,"headingSupplementInternational":44,"subheadingInternational":44,"promoTextInternational":259,"destination_countries":260,"quickLinks":268,"footerLinks":269,"footerLinksInternational":308,"name":320,"tabName":321,"tabDataGtmTrack":322},{"dimensions":247,"alt":250,"copyright":44,"url":251,"id":252,"edit":253},{"width":248,"height":249},88,24,"Monotype Evri Send Logo","courier-service-warrington.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+%281%29.svg","ZcyF-hIAACgAGOcv",{"x":58,"y":58,"zoom":59,"background":95},"from £2.62","(£2.18 + VAT)","Pay less for UK parcels up to 15kg vs. Royal Mail Click & Drop**","SALE: Up to £1.27 off 0-2kg parcels​","a parcel internationally from £6.08","FREE end-to-end tracking with every parcel",{"link_type":261,"key":262,"kind":263,"id":264,"url":265,"name":266,"size":267},"Media","c